# The Gambonanza build this checkout of the framework was last verified against.
#
# The framework binds to a lot of private game state by name (reflection), so a
# game update is the usual suspect when something stops working. build.sh hashes
# the vanilla Assembly-CSharp.dll on every run and prints a note when it differs
# from what's recorded here.
#
# To re-verify after a game update:
#   1. ./build.sh
#   2. Launch the game, open the console (F10), run `mods` and `list gambits`.
#   3. If everything works, update the two values below and note what changed.

